&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2.运行时有关设备树的加载流程：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/linux-driver-learn/6.png&#34;
	width=&#34;775&#34;
	height=&#34;470&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/linux-driver-learn/6_hu_6b50129704e57f8e.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/linux-driver-learn/6_hu_b6da80d2faeb9433.png 1024w&#34;
