&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3.有关板级设备树dtb在系统启动中的配置寻找&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/linux-driver-learn/7.png&#34;
	width=&#34;778&#34;
	height=&#34;608&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/linux-driver-learn/7_hu_88ad1dfe83517337.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/linux-driver-learn/7_hu_488ed9e8932cf330.png 1024w&#34;
